    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to this superbly presented four-bedroom detached residence occupying an enviable corner site overlooking a large green area. Constructed in 2023 and finished to an exceptional standard throughout, this contemporary family home offers bright, spacious accommodation together with an impressive range of modern energy-efficient features.\r\nIdeally situated within walking distance of Mallow Town Centre and adjacent to the Mallow GAA Sports Complex at Carrigoon, the property also enjoys convenient access to the Cork/Limerick Road network, making it an excellent choice for commuters and families alike."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nEntrance hall, livingroom, kitchen/dining area, utility room, and guest wc on the ground floor. Upstairs comprises of four bedrooms - master en suite and bathroom"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall -  18' 6\"  x  7' 6\" \r\n•\tBright welcoming hallway\n•\tQuality tiled flooring throughout\n•\tSpacious and stylish first impression\n\r\n\r\nLivingroom -  17' 3\"  x  15' 9\" \r\n•\tGenerous family living space\n•\tAttractive tiled flooring\n•\tDouble bay windows to the front and gable providing excellent natural light\n\r\n\r\nKitchen.dining area - \r\nKitchen                                                                                                 21'4\" x 10'7\"\n•\tModern fitted kitchen with island unit\n•\tIntegrated oven and hob\n•\tIntegrated dishwasher, fridge and freezer\n•\tExtensive worktop and storage space\n•\tTiled flooring\nDining Area                                                                                          10'0\" x 8'6\"\n•\tOpen-plan dining space\n•\tFrench doors leading to patio and rear garden\n•\tIdeal for family dining and entertaining\n\r\n\r\nUtility room -  4' 7\"  x  4' 7\" \r\n•\tConvenient utility space\n•\tTiled flooring\n\r\n\r\nGuest wc -  4' 9\"  x  4' 9\" \r\n•\tFully tiled flooring\n•\tContemporary fittings\n\n\r\n\r\nLanding/stairs - \r\n•\tCarpeted stairs and landing\n•\tCloak/storage area beneath stairs\n•\tBright and spacious area\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  16' 6\"  x  12' 3\" \r\n•\tLarge double bedroom\n•\tAttractive bay window\n•\tCarpet flooring\n\nEn-Suite                                                                                                    8'8\" x 4'9\"\n•\tTiled flooring\n•\tFully tiled shower area\n\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  10'   x  8'  \r\n•\tCarpet flooring\n•\tBuilt-in wardrobes\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  12' 4\"  x  10' 3\" \r\n•\tCarpet flooring\n•\tBuilt-in wardrobes\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 -  13'   x  11'  \r\n•\tSpacious double bedroom\n•\tCarpet flooring\n\r\n\r\nBathroom -  7' 3\"  x  7'  \r\n•\tTiled flooring\n•\tModern sanitary ware\n\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outstanding Features\r\n•\tA2 Energy Rating\r\n•\tMitsubishi air to water heating system with underfloor heating\r\n•\tBuilt in 2023\r\n•\tDetached family residence\r\n•\tBlinds come as part of the sale\r\n•\tFloored attic with electrical power connections\r\n•\tHeat Recovery Ventilation System\r\n•\tWater Filtration System\r\n•\tOutside tap\r\n•\tMaintenance-free brick driveway\r\n•\tProfessionally planted front garden\r\n•\tLarge private rear garden\r\n•\tSpacious patio area\r\n•\tGarden shed included\r\n•\tSide access to both sides of property\r\n•\tAttractive corner site location\r\n•\tOverlooking large green area\r\n•\tAdjacent to Mallow GAA Sports Complex, Carrigoon\r\n•\tWalking distance to Mallow Town Centre"
